    "godet_plane_desc": "Canonical visualization of the Indirect Influence Matrix (IIM) and Indirect Dependence Matrix (IDM). Vectors indicate the structural displacement from direct baseline (M¹) to the stabilized matrix power (Mᵏ).",
    "godet_plane_lbl_k": "Indirect Power (k):",
